        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba waxaa maalin dhacay inuu Yoonaataan ina Saa'uul ku yidhi ninkii dhallinyarada ahaa oo hubkiisa u siday, Bal ina keen aan ciidanka reer Falastiin oo xaggaas jooga u gudubnee. Laakiinse taas uma uu sheegin aabbihiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Saa'uulna wuxuu joogay Gibecaah darafkeeda, oo wuxuu hoos fadhiyey geed rummaanka ah oo Migroon ku yaal; oo dadkii isaga la joogayna waxay ahaayeen in ku dhow lix boqol oo nin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Axiiyaah oo ahaa ina Axiituub, oo Iikaboodna walaalkiis ahaa, ee ahaa reer Fiinexaas ina Ceelii oo ahaa wadaadkii Rabbiga oo Shiiloh joogay, isagoo eefod qaba. Oo dadkuna ma ogayn inuu Yoonaataan tegey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yoonaataan marinkii uu doonayay inuu uga gudbo ciidanka reer Falastiin waxaa dhinac kaga yiil buur dhagax ah, dinaca kalena waxaa kaga yiil buur dhagax ah, oo middood magaceedu wuxuu ahaa Boosees, oo tan kale magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Seneh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo buur waxay ku tiil xagga woqooyi oo Mikmaash ka horraysa, oo tan kalena waxay ku tiil xagga koonfureed oo Gebacda horraysa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoonaataan wuxuu ku yidhi ninkii dhallinyarada ahaa oo hubkiisa u siday, Kaalay, oo ina keen aan xagga ciidanka buuryoqabka ah u gudubnee, waayo, waxaa suurtowda in Rabbigu inoo shaqeeyo, maxaa yeelay, Rabbiga waxba kama hor joogsan karaan inuu ku badbaadiyo kuwo badan ama kuwo yarba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kii hubka u sidayna wuxuu ku yidhi, Wax alla waxa qalbigaaga ku jira yeel, oo bal eeg, waan kula socdaa, oo sida qalbigaagu yahay weeye kayguna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoonaataan wuxuu yidhi, Bal eeg, nimanka xaggooda ayaynu u gudbaynaa, oo isu muujinaynaa iyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddii ay inagu yidhaahdaan, Jooga halkiinna ilaa aannu idiin nimaadno, markaas waxaynu iska joogaynaa meesheenna, oo una tegi mayno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse haddii ay inagu yidhaahdaan, Kaalaya soo fuula, markaasaynu fuulaynaa, waayo, Rabbigu iyaga gacanteennuu soo geliyey, oo taasaa calaamadii inoo ahaan doonta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo labadoodiiba waxay isu muujiyeen ciidankii reer Falastiin; markaasay kuwii reer Falastiin waxay yidhaahdeen, Bal eega Cibraaniyadii waxay ka soo baxayaan godadkii ay ku dhuunteene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo raggii ciidanku waxay Yoonaataan iyo kii hubkiisa u siday ugu jawaabeen oo ku yidhaahdeen, Soo fuula, wax baannu idin tusaynaaye. Markaasaa Yoonaataan wuxuu ku yidhi kii hubkiisa u siday, Iga soo daba fuul, waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu iyaga soo geliyey gacanta reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoonaataan buurtii fantay, kii hubkiisa u sidayna wuu daba socday, oo kuwii reer Falastiinna way ku hor dhaceen Yoonaataan, kii hubkiisa u sidayna wuu ka daba laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoonaataan iyo kii hubkiisa u siday intii ugu horraysay oo ay laayeen waxay ahayd in ku dhow labaatan nin oo ay ku laayeen goob nus tacab ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reer Binu Israa'iil Oo Ka Adkaaday Reer Falastiin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo cabsi weyn bay la qadhqadheen kuwii xerada ku jiray, iyo kuwii duurka joogay iyo dadkii oo dhanba; oo xataa ciidankii, iyo waxdhacayaashuna way wada gariireen, oo dhulkuna waa gariiray, haddana waxaa jiray gariir aad iyo aad u weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul waardiyayaashiisii Gibecaahdii reer Benyaamiin joogay wax fiiriyeen, oo waxay arkeen dadkii badnaa oo kala firdhay oo xaggan iyo xaggaa u kala yaacay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu dadkii isaga la jiray ku yidhi, Bal tiriya, oo eega kii inaga tegey kuu yahay. Oo markay tiriyeen waxay arkeen inayan Yoonaataan iyo kii hubkiisa u siday halkaas joogin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu Axiiyaah ku yidhi, Sanduuqii Ilaah halkan keen. Waayo, waagaas sanduuqa Ilaah wuxuu la jiray reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu Saa'uul la hadlayay wadaadkii, rabshaddii ku jirtay xerada reer Falastiin ayaa sii adkaatay oo sii badatay; kolkaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu wadaadkii ku yidhi, Gacanta laab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul iyo dadkii la jiray oo dhammuba isa soo wada urursadeen, oo waxay yimaadeen goobtii dagaalka. Oo bal eeg, nin walba seeftiisii waxay ku dhacday saaxiibkiis, oo waxaa jiray baabba' aad u weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Cibraaniyadii markii hore la jiray reer Falastiin, oo intay raaceen xerada la galay, iyagoo dalka ku wareegsan ka yimid, xataa iyana way soo jeesteen, oo waxay ku darmadeen reer binu Israa'iilkii la jiray Saa'uul iyo Yoonaataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas oo kalena kulli raggii reer binu Israa'iil oo mar hore ku dhuuntay dalka buuraha leh oo reer Efrayim, iyana markii ay maqleen in reer Falastiin carareen ayay soo raacdaysteen oo dagaalkii soo galeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasuu Rabbigu maalintaas u badbaadiyey reer binu Israa'iil; oo dagaalkiina wuxuu u sii gudbay xagga Beytaawen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoonaataan Oo Cunay Malab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas dadka reer binu Israa'iil way dhibaataysnaayeen; laakiinse Saa'uul baa dadkii dhaariyey oo ku yidhi, Ilaa ay fiidkii noqoto, oo aan cadaawayaashayda ka aarsado ninkii wax cuna inkaaru ha ku dhacdo. Haddaba dadkii cunto ma dhadhamin innaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii oo dhammu waxay soo galeen duurkii, dhulkana waxaa yiil malab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii dadkii soo galay duurkii ayaa malabkii soo dareeray, laakiinse ninna gacanta afka ma saarin, waayo, dadku waxay ka cabsadeen dhaartii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Yoonaataan ma uu maqlin markii aabbihiis dadka dhaarta ku amray, sidaas aawadeed wuxuu soo fidiyey ushii gacanta ugu jirtay caaraddeedii, oo wuxuu daray malabkii, markaasuu gacantii afka saaray; oo indhihiisiina aad bay u iftiimeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa dadkii mid ka mid ahu u jawaabay, oo ku yidhi, Aabbahaa dadka dhaar buu aad ugu amray oo yidhi, Maanta ninkii wax cuna inkaaru ha ku dhacdo. Oo dadkiina way itaal darnaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoonaataan wuxuu yidhi, Aabbahay isagaa dalka dhibay, waan idin baryayaaye, bal eega sida indhahaygu u iftiimeen, maxaa yeelay, in yar baan ka dhadhamiyey malabkan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba intee bay ka sii fiicnaan lahayd haddii dadku maanta ikhtiyaar wax uga cuni lahaayeen wixii ay cadaawayaashooda ka dhaceen ee ay heleen? Waayo, hadday sidaas ahaan lahayd reer Falastiin dhexdooda layn tan ka weyn baa ku dhici lahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas waxay reer Falastiin ku laayeen ilaa Mikmaash iyo tan iyo Ayaaloon; oo dadkuna aad bay u itaal darnaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkiina wixii ay dhaceen ayay ku boodeen, oo waxay qaateen ido iyo dibi iyo weylo, oo dhulkay ku qasheen, markaasaa dadkii waxay cuneen hilibkii oo dhiig leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabadeedna waxaa loo sheegay Saa'uul, oo lagu yidhi, Bal eeg, dadku Rabbigay ku dembaabaan, markay cunaan hilib dhiig leh. Markaasuu wuxuu ku yidhi, Aad baad u xadgudubteen, haddaba maanta ii soo giringiriya dhagax weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu yidhi, Dadka dhex gala, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaan, Nin waluba halkan ha iigu keeno dibigiisa, nin walubana laxdiisa, oo halkan ku gowraca oo cuna; oo Rabbiga ha ku dembaabina intaad hilib dhiig leh cuntaan. Habeenkaas dadkii oo dhammu nin waluba wuxuu keenay dibigiisii, kolkaasay halkaas ku gowraceen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu Rabbiga u dhisay meel allabari, oo taasuna waxay ahayd meeshii allabariga ee ugu horraysay uu Rabbiga u dhiso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saa'uulna wuxuu yidhi, Ina keena aynu reer Falastiin raacdaysannee oo habeennimo mirnee, oo tan iyo aroortii dhacnee, oo ninkoodna yeynan ka sii dayn. Oo iyana waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Wax alla wixii kula wanaagsan samee. Markaasaa wadaadkii wuxuu yidhi, Ina keena aynu Rabbiga u dhowaannee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul Ilaah talo weyddiistay, oo wuxuu yidhi, Miyaan reer Falastiin raacdaystaa? Oo ma doonaysaa inaad iyaga soo geliso gacanta reer binu Israa'iil? Laakiinse maalintaas Ilaah uma uu jawaabin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu yidhi, Madaxda reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammay, soo dhowaada, oo maanta dembiganu wuxuu ku jiray bal soo ogaada oo soo eega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbiga reer binu Israa'iil badbaadiya noloshiisaan ku dhaartaye, xataa hadduu ku jiray wiilkayga Yoonaataan, hubaal kaasu wuu dhiman doonaa. Laakiinse dadkii oo dhan laguma arag nin u jawaabay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan ku yidhi, Idinku dhan joogsada, aniga iyo wiilkayga Yoonaataanna dhanka kale ayaannu joogsanaynaa. Dadkiina waxay Saa'uul ku yidhaahdeen, Wixii kula wanaagsan samee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Saa'uul wuxuu ku yidhi Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil, Saamiga runta ah na tus. Oo wuxuu saamigii ku dhacay Yoonaataan iyo Saa'uul, laakiinse dadkii way baxeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu yidhi, Noo saami rida aniga iyo wiilkayga Yoonaataan. Dabadeedna saamigii wuxuu ku dhacay Yoonaataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu Yoonaataan ku yidhi, Bal ii sheeg waxaad samaysay. Oo Yoonaataan wuu u sheegay oo ku yidhi, Xaqiiqa in yar oo malab ah ayaan ku dhadhamiyey ushii gacanta iigu jirtay caaraddeedii; haddaba waa inaan dhintaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu ku yidhi, Ilaah saas iyo si ka sii daran ha sameeyo, waayo, Yoonaataan, hubaal waa inaad dhimataa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii waxay Saa'uul ku yidhaahdeen, Yoonaataan oo badbaadadan weyn ku dhex sameeyey reer binu Israa'iil, ma inuu dhintaa? Yaanay noqon; Rabbiga noloshiisaan ku dhaarannay ee waa inaan tin keliya oo madaxiisu dhulka ku dhicin; waayo, isagu wuxuu maanta la shaqeeyey Ilaah. Sidaasay dadkii u samatabbixiyeen Yoonaataan inuusan dhiman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Saa'uul wuxuu ka hadhay reer Falastiin raacdaysigoodii; oo reer Falastiinna meeshoodii bay tageen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
